      "id": "2082556871358251345",
      "lang": "en",
      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "having a good, fast, and cheap model like Grok 4.5 on fast mode changes the calculus on how i approach my work. because it's so much cheaper and faster, i have been using \"verification swarms\" for my PRs whereas in the past i might have only spawned one verifier due to the cost. \n\nmodel cost & speed without compromise on quality makes massively parallel agent swarms possible and increases my confidence as i orchestrate many large projects simultaneously"
      },
